{"parse": {"title": "晃铃响于山谷-03", "pageid": 89642, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%99%83%E9%93%83%E5%93%8D%E4%BA%8E%E5%B1%B1%E8%B0%B7-02\" title=\"晃铃响于山谷-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">晃铃响于山谷-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%99%83%E9%93%83%E5%93%8D%E4%BA%8E%E5%B1%B1%E8%B0%B7-04\" title=\"晃铃响于山谷-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">晃铃响于山谷</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.88.A9.E9.BD.BF.E4.B8.8E.E6.8B.B3.E8.85.95\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"利齿与拳腕\">利齿与拳腕</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 利齿与拳腕</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Fangs and Fists</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>序幕</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>羊群</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"3\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>石阵·其一</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"4\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>石阵·其二（分支1）</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"5\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>石阵·其二（分支2）</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"6\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>浆果</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"7\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>落幕</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-powunei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"powunei\"><img alt=\"powunei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-powunei.png/600px-Cg-powunei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-powunei.png/900px-Cg-powunei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-powunei.png/1200px-Cg-powunei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>剧烈的疼痛将他的意识从混沌中唤醒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火焰、巨象……所有幻象抽离而去——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>呃……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>发疼的腹部，伤口上敷着捣碎了的草药，散发出一股刺鼻的气味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他坐起来。墙面上挂着动物的骸骨，粗糙的木头桌上、柜子上……摆放着各式各样的瓶罐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一张面具被绳子吊起来，悬挂于屋子中心。它的面容狰狞，显露不容侵犯的威严。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>……看上去找对地方了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一张纸条被石头压在椅子上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“关好门。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>哈哈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看来木屋的主人不是一个热心肠的家伙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但被人拒绝向来不是什么问题……他如今剩下的只有耐心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他起身推开吱呀叫唤的木门，踏出门槛——在主人回来之前，他需要先解决一下自己的饥饿问题。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>溪流涌动，一群塔尔羊聚集在水边啜饮。它们看起来温顺、笨拙，毫无警戒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>好的，好的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他努力无视胃酸对胃部的折磨。匕首在掌心轻轻转动，脚步也逐渐变得小心翼翼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>呼，拜托，继续大口大口地喝吧……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一只羊冷不丁地抬起头，与他四目相对。横瞳中倒映的匕首闪闪发亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>糟了！可恶——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——犹如瞬间崩断的线，它鼠窜而逃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>其余羊儿响应逃跑的号召，陆陆续续地跑起来。转眼间，鬃毛沙砾孤零零地矗立在原地，犹如平原上的一杆独枝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>唉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他一屁股坐在石头上，长吁了一口气。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"3\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他冲洗着脏污的面容，冰冷的水让他更为清醒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>深入森林，找一些浆果填饱肚子——如果幸运，他还有机会为那位未谋面的老萨满准备一份见面礼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>“恩泽必报”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>……家族给我留下的为数不多有用的教诲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他随手捡起几颗石子塞进口袋，这让野兽畏惧，也方便击落树上的浆果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>——嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他紧皱眉头，拉开距离，地上的石子有规律地排列着，摆出一个像是符咒的石阵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>这……是什么……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>因为他的破坏，石阵已不再完整。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>像——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>唔哦——痛！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他低下头，一只毛茸茸的卡邦克鲁咬住他的大腿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>……？你是从哪里窜出来的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他抬起腿，使劲一甩，卡邦克鲁被晃到半空中，像只从树梢跌落的雏鸟，狠狠摔在松软的土壤上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"617501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-617501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-617501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"617501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-617501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-617501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-617501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-617501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡邦克鲁：</div><div>%@#！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鬃毛沙砾把它捏到眼前，端详着这个小小的怪东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>忽然，它安静下来，意味深长地咧起嘴。鬃毛沙砾扭过头——成群结队的卡邦克鲁，正气势汹汹地朝自己涌来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡邦克鲁群：</div><div>%@#！%@#！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>……一定要这样吗，小毛球？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>你……想做个交易吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被捏住的卡邦克鲁眯着眼，一言不发，看来并不打算放过他……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>……好吧。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"4\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一场惨烈的战斗结束……小毛球跳上倒地的躯体，沿着背部爬到鬃毛沙砾的后脑勺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它昂首，衔起树枝，骄傲地宣告这次伟大的胜利。底下的卡邦克鲁们簇拥在一起，蹦蹦乱跳。这是一场茸毛球的盛会，将载入它们的史册。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在每只卡邦克鲁都在他身上留下脚印后，盛会终于迎来结束……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>唉，我早该习惯这些……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>起身，拍拍身上的泥土，空荡荡的胃部催促着他的脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>还没到停下来的时候，但他深知，这副疲惫的身躯已不能再加入一场新的动荡。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"5\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一场惨烈的战斗结束……卡邦克鲁们一蹦一蹦地四散而逃，只剩小毛球留在原地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它浑身发抖，却依旧昂首站在鬃毛沙砾面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鬃毛沙砾面无表情，朝着毛球举起树枝，长长的影子落在毛球身上，汗液濡湿了茸毛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>树枝挥舞而下，却落在别处——毛球终于抵御不住恐惧，“哇哇”嚷着逃走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>丢掉树枝，他拍拍身上的泥土，空荡荡的胃部催促着他的脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>还没到停下来的时候，但他深知，这副疲惫的身躯已不能再加入一场新的动荡。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"6\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>丛林向来都是群狼的窝巢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无暇顾及的浆果散落一地。但它们虎视眈眈，龇牙咧嘴地发出低嚎，显然不打算放他离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>过来……试着过来，朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他当然无法与群狼抗争。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但至少此刻，后退与前进同样危险——虚张声势亦是一种生存哲学。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>在你们的牙齿刺入脖颈之前，我会先把你们热乎乎的肚子一个个剖开！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>头狼步步紧逼，身后的狼群远远地跟在后面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他掏出匕首，双腿本能地打战。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他后撤一步，撒开步伐，往树林里冲去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>狼群跃动的声响并未消失，紧随其后……</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"7\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongshenchu_zhou\"><img alt=\"linzhongshenchu_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png/600px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png/900px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这里已是尽头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>万丈悬崖下，是一条湍急、细长的河流。秃鹫在高空盘旋，等待着新鲜的尸体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他已无路可退。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>狼群停住了脚步。对于这顿盘中餐来说，它们现在要考虑的，是如何以最小的代价……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他闭上眼，鼻翼颤缩，吸了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>如果能停在这里……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>狼群围攻而上，他松开了手中的匕首——此刻任何一只利爪都可以撕开他的身体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-509601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-509601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-509601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>吁——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>哨声鸣起，狼群的动作一滞，迅速退回到了原来的位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>佝偻的身躯从森林迈出来，他随手给狼群丢去一块腐肉。头狼叼起肉块，一言不发地带着从狼离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-614101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-614101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-614101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">萨满：</div><div>呵……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他微微侧头，目光滑过地上的匕首，瞥了一眼伫立崖边的身影，头也不回地往森林走去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鬃毛沙砾望着佝偻的背影渐行渐远，终于从错愕中醒来，小跑着跟了上去。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "晃铃响于山谷-03"}}